    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"stop carrying it all\"... that's exactly what it feels like. just sitting there in the dark, thinking about how much quieter it would be if i just didn't have to wake up and face it again. like, why is continuing the fight the only option? it's just more noise. sometimes it seems like the only way to actually find some peace is to just let the cycle stop.",
